  "minorCheck": "Current 30 EC minor covers programming, computer systems, introduction to cyber security, cybersecurity ethics and cybersecurity governance. The graduate account establishes a Security Studies elective-space use case, while the current catalogue independently establishes the stable minor. The account itself does not establish a formal specialisation.",
